ed for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10809,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"766t_J4So0I","position":55,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Sunclef - Raise It Up (dillavamp)","track":{"id":"xqJZOPIeHy0","path":"/artists/sunclef/tracks/raise-it-up-dillavamp/","slug":"raise-it-up-dillavamp","title":"Raise It Up (dillavamp)","artist":{"slug":"sunclef","title":"Sunclef"},"artwork":"images/artists/sunclef/tracks/raise-it-up-dillavamp.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"crc06un0Xp8","slug":"245","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-245/ra.1080836292","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-245-dilla-tribute"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #245 (Dilla Tribute)","artwork":"/images/episodes/245.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7271,"location":"US","published_at":"2016-02-06T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}}],"albums":[{"id":"Tajh6UONG9k","title":"Attoseconds","artist":"ddIkRTkeG3U","artwork":"/images/albums/EZ9B90Dnw8_.jpeg"}],"linkedPlatforms":[]}